   1157  f632							; TitleBandPrep — called by TitlePlayerBand at band entry (same-bank jsr).
   1158  f632							; Sets Grp0Ptr frame (walk phases 4/6 alternate PlayerWalkA/B on EnemyRamP
   1159  f632							; bit3, phases 2/3/5/7 static A, phases 0/1/8 jet flutter), REFP0 =
   1160  f632							; PlayerDir<<3 (bit3 = mirror, kernel.asm:602), FooterPtr1 = bomb state (draw rows), COLUP1 = fuse color or
   1161  f632							; COLUBK = explosion blink color (same (60-BombTimer)&3 table as the game's
   1162  f632							; BombBlinkColors). Band tail restores COLUBK/REFP0 before the footer.
