   1169  f632							; here) -> bank0's `jmp LF_B0Tail`, which runs EnterRoom + the level-start
   1170  f632							; placement + `jmp DropArm` in bank0. 0 extra jsr levels, 0 pushes: the stack
   1171  f632							; depth of boot/RESET/title/tally (sim_bomb_fuse, test_tally) is unchanged.
   1172  f632							; Why: the level index + tables ARE bank2 level data, so the 7 FoldIndirect
   1173  f632							; reads (7 x 25c, 14 switches) are direct (FetchPtr),Y reads here.
   1174  f632							; Entry layout (7 B stride): miner_room (b7 = faces right), miner_x, wall
   1175  f632							; color, wall color 2, block base word (RoomShapes), room count n. The
   1176  f632							; start room / start x / start y / miner y are kernel constants (0/32/24/84).
