   1934  fca6				   ExitEdgeTab
   1935  fca6		       84 00 9f 04	      .byte.b	PLAYER_MAX_Y, PLAYER_MIN_Y, PLAYER_MAX_X, PLAYER_MIN_X
   1936  fcaa
